%% etcd Data Flow - Write and Read Paths
%% Commit: d6bc3229d81384aed0fc03a3ddd3dccfef092048

sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant G as gRPC Handler
    participant S as EtcdServer
    participant R as Raft
    participant W as WAL
    participant P as Peers
    participant A as Applier
    participant M as MVCC Store
    participant B as BoltDB

    Note over C,B: Write Path (Put)

    C->>G: Put(key, value)
    G->>G: Validate request
    G->>S: Process Put
    S->>R: Propose entry

    par Durability
        R->>W: Write WAL entry
        W->>W: fsync()
    and Replication
        R->>P: Append entries
        P-->>R: Acknowledge
    end

    R->>R: Entry committed
    R->>S: Ready to apply
    S->>A: Apply entry
    A->>M: Put to store
    M->>M: Update index
    M->>B: Batch write
    B->>B: Commit tx
    A-->>S: Applied
    S-->>G: Response
    G-->>C: PutResponse

    Note over C,B: Read Path (Linearizable)

    C->>G: Get(key)
    G->>S: Range request
    S->>R: Read index
    R->>P: Heartbeat (confirm leader)
    P-->>R: Acknowledge
    R-->>S: Read state
    S->>S: Wait for apply index
    S->>M: Range query
    M->>B: Read from backend
    B-->>M: Key-Value
    M-->>S: Result
    S-->>G: Response
    G-->>C: RangeResponse

    Note over C,B: Read Path (Serializable)

    C->>G: Get(key, serializable)
    G->>S: Range request
    S->>M: Range query (direct)
    M->>B: Read from backend
    B-->>M: Key-Value
    M-->>S: Result
    S-->>G: Response
    G-->>C: RangeResponse
